==Battleground==
*3 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*4 [[Manic King Dragon (Enemy)|Manic King Dragons]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*20 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage replaces the infinite amount of Dragons with a M. Ost and Relic Doge support. Your main goal will be to kill the M. Ost as soon as you can and chip down the Manic Dragons after. [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk]] can be used to great affect here to both crowd control everything and deal gradual chip damage to the 4 dragons in the back. To deal with the M. Ost, [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Doron]] can freeze it while [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi]] deal massive amounts of damage to it before she dies. Afterwards, units like [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Grandmaster]] can deal good damage to the M. Ost, as well as help chipping down the Dragons after. Without the right units, this stage may take a while.

